                "text": "🚀 Safe Merge Dry Run \"hjwylde/review/ruby-35347-remove-gem-tests\" started\n[Show Merge Request in SpaceCode](https://jetbrains.team/p/IJ/reviews/231618/timeline)\n\nRepository: `ultimate`\nFrom: `hjwylde/review/ruby-35347-remove-gem-tests`\nTo: `master`\n\nChanges:\n• [c1425c5](https://jetbrains.team/p/IJ/repositories/ultimate/revision/c1425c56b5de9390035f2619b9ffb93740bda99b) Pre-merge `master` changes into temp branch for running tests\n• [0b9e8da](https://jetbrains.team/p/IJ/repositories/ultimate/revision/0b9e8da6502173d26907c3a91389a552d7144a4d) [RUBY-35347](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-35347) remove version restrictions on ckedit and turbolinks in SprocketsCompletionContributorTest\n• [a6668ec](https://jetbrains.team/p/IJ/repositories/ultimate/revision/a6668ec5f82b28600b9ea09f1b7c51b1998d8a7b) [RUBY-35347](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-35347) remove use of `cucumber-api-steps` gem in Ruby tests\n• [abd04ef](https://jetbrains.team/p/IJ/repositories/ultimate/revision/abd04ef6d7ab6cbc0d8b7740c20e7a067b50675f) [RUBY-35347](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-35347) remove use of `extlib` gem in Ruby tests\n• [fa663e6](https://jetbrains.team/p/IJ/repositories/ultimate/revision/fa663e61870ba0e69c13aa41a5c1c43d439fb1ef) [RUBY-35347](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-35347) remove use of `react-source` gem in Ruby tests\n(displayed 5 of 6)\n\n[https://patronus.labs.jb.gg/robot/00c1d8af-c868-4d6c-96d3-c9e0fda13350](https://patronus.labs.jb.gg/robot/00c1d8af-c868-4d6c-96d3-c9e0fda13350)",
